WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:03.552
A move from Crowdin keeps
your resource files,

2
00:00:03.552 --> 00:00:06.639
i18n library, and
reviewed translations.

3
00:00:07.150 --> 00:00:10.749
General Translation keeps those
files and translates only new

4
00:00:10.749 --> 00:00:12.165
and changed strings.

5
00:00:13.650 --> 00:00:16.796
First, turn on Skip
untranslated strings,

6
00:00:16.796 --> 00:00:19.442
so source text is not
imported as translations.

7
00:00:20.150 --> 00:00:21.671
Then run crowdin download,

8
00:00:21.671 --> 00:00:25.235
and clear the Sync Schedule so
Crowdin's Git integration stops

9
00:00:25.235 --> 00:00:26.558
pushing translations.

10
00:00:27.150 --> 00:00:30.598
Point gt.config.json
at the same files,

11
00:00:30.598 --> 00:00:33.093
and import your glossary
into a Context Group.

12
00:00:33.650 --> 00:00:39.014
Run npx gt upload before
the first npx gt translate,

13
00:00:39.014 --> 00:00:40.545
which then runs in your build.

14
00:00:41.150 --> 00:00:43.692
Your team now ships
German with each release.
